e can call rather than a loop inside a print block. Three readers beside it never got that treatment. ⚑ AND THE PARAMETER IS WHAT MAKES THEM TESTABLE: the origin's resolve can only be exercised against the live 5800-line roster, so pinning its ambiguity refusal means finding real keys that collide. A three-entry fixture states it directly. The five-zeroes case (co_names matched without the leading underscore, every witness landed in ?) is now a live assertion that known kinds are non-empty. ⚑⚑ THE Any SEAM COST THREE ROUNDS AND CONFIRMED pyproject's OWN RULE: a dynamically loaded module is Any, runtime_checkable Protocol checks PRESENCE not TYPE, vars() is dict[str,Any], and under disallow_any_expr the Any is flagged BEFORE a cast could concretise it. The fix was to isolate the read in its own frame whose Protocol-declared attribute type makes it concrete, then narrow element-wise.}
