  note     = {kind=unwitnessed by=substrate. MEASURED on two live arms. dag_source_selftest.the_generator_is_not_debt and tool_census_selftest.the_live_census_is_not_empty both read as a bail on an empty call result followed by a guard over that same value. In the first the emptiness means the fixture did not produce and the guard protects the fixture. In the second the emptiness IS the claim -- its docstring says THE FIXTURE ARMS PROVE THE MECHANISM THIS PROVES IT REACHES. The discriminator is whether the probed value came from a constructed fixture or the live subject, a property of the provider rather than a shape in the guard. Third syntactic discriminator refuted in this arc after the two reverted in gate-G44. ⚑ WITNESS NOTE, moved verbatim from findings.py WITNESSES (2026-09-26): gate-G47 specified narrowing relation_arm to tell a fixture precondition from a claim guard and the AST cannot carry it. the_generator_is_not_debt and the_live_census_is_not_empty have byte-identical guard structure -- a bail on an empty call result followed by a guard over that same value -- and mean opposite things. In the first the emptiness means the fixture did not produce. In the second it IS the claim. that arm exists precisely to assert the live census is non-empty. The discriminator is whether the probed value came from a constructed fixture or from the live subject, which is a property of the PROVIDER and not a shape in the guard. Third syntactic discriminator refuted in this arc after the two in gate-G44.}
}

