origin spells them as bare literals at every return, so its own suite cannot say this must not be UNRUNNABLE without restating the encoding. And mypy refused the dynamically loaded origin as Any, which is the climode lesson exactly. every read off it typechecks against nothing so a misspelled attribute passes and a differential that agrees with anything is worthless. A Protocol names the two functions and makes the reach explicit. Remaining units are the WITNESSES roster at 5900 lines, which is DATA and belongs in a bib, and the 700 lines of readers.}
