F10 diverge at the character after the shared prefix. So the population exercising the refusal is abbreviations a caller would plausibly type, and a stem census reports zero while the machinery is heavily used. The differential now runs over every live key plus every ambiguous abbreviation and both resolvers agree throughout.}
