by the deletion of its subject. So exit 0 at filing time means documented and nothing else, and a mode finding asserts the reverse. The measured instance is gate-F55, filed with a witness reporting DOCUMENTED under a claim that the flag is documented AS A REDIRECT and not dispatched, caught only by a manual run. THE SUITE IS DIFFERENTIAL IN TWO DIRECTIONS AT ONCE. It asserts AGREEMENT with the origin on refuses and selftest, and asserts DISAGREEMENT on mode by running the origin and confirming it returns None there. An intended divergence that is not cased reads exactly like an accidental one, and if this ever starts agreeing either the origin grew the arm or this module lost it -- both want a human.}
