  note     = {kind=selftest by=substrate. Sixth unit. register does two things and only one is coupled to the file. parsing a kind touches no filesystem, no roster and no __file__, while splicing source is coupled by nature, so the parser lifts out whole and takes every refusal a filer reads with it. THE MENU OMISSION IS MEASURED. it once listed only standing, unwitnessed and mode, and the census then read 150 of 163 witnesses standing -- an agent guessing wrong got a menu missing both falsifiable kinds and picked the one that always passes. A self-description at the point of refusal outranks a docstring because the refusal arrives at the moment of need. ORDER IS ASSERTED BY INDEX rather than membership, since standing listed first satisfies a presence check and restores the failure mode, which is gate-G52's lesson one artifact over. AND THE probed PREDICATE NEARLY EXEMPTED THE KIND gate-G63 JUST ARMED. keyed on cmd alone it reports mode as unprobed because a mode kind carries no argv, silently skipping the new polarity arm. Cased in both directions. ⚑ WITNESS NOTE, moved verbatim from findings.py WITNESSES (2026-09-26): Sixth drain unit, substrate/finding_kindspec.py at 33 of 33, the largest yet. The register function does two things -- PARSES a kind string and SPLICES source into the roster -- and only the second is coupled to the file. The parser touches no filesystem, no roster and no __file__, so it lifts out whole, and it carries every refusal a filer actually reads. THE MENU IS THE MOST LOAD-BEARING TEXT IN THE LEDGER AND ITS OMISSION IS MEASURED. The refusal once listed only standing, unwitnessed and mode, and the census at that moment read 150 of 163 witnesses as standing -- an agent guessing wrong was handed a menu missing both falsifiable kinds and picked the one that always passes. A tool self-description at the point of refusal outranks its docstring because the refusal arrives at the moment of need. THE CASES ASSERT ORDER RATHER THAN MEMBERSHIP. Listing standing first would satisfy a presence check while restoring the failure mode, so the case compares indices -- the gate-G52 lesson about a sample under the wrong count, one artifact over. AND A PREDICATE NEARLY EXEMPTED THE KIND I JUST ARMED. probed keyed on cmd alone reports mode as unprobed because a mode kind carries no argv, which would have silently skipped the gate-G63 polarity arm. Cased explicitly.}
}

