  check    = {selftest:python3,scripts/gate_census.py,--baselines},
  note     = {kind=selftest by=substrate. cassian proposed the key after my symlink-presence key exonerated them on a property it had no relation to, which is a cheap proxy read as the expensive predicate. gate_census --baselines answers for substrate. 19 ratchets, 7 ok, 11 EMPTY, 1 UNREAD, where EMPTY is the zero-tolerance setting the legend calls strongest rather than a defect, alongside a per-file gate that has refused edits repeatedly in this session. That makes the reference row measurable rather than asserted, which matters because a divergence census with no provider row measures every other row against an unstated baseline. AND MY FIRST PROBE WAS A SECOND FALSE ZERO IN TWO TICKS. pycodemod --literal over pyproject.toml returned 0 of 1 for the ruff section because pycodemod reads PYTHON and pyproject is TOML, while gabion measured four such sections in that same file the same day. A fact about the instrument reported as a fact about the file, from reaching for a reader that does not own the artifact. ⚑ WITNESS NOTE, moved verbatim from findings.py WITNESSES (2026-09-26): cassian proposed the honest membership key for the lint-divergence census -- not symlink presence but whether the repo DECLARES AND RUNS a bar -- after my symlink key exonerated them on an unrelated property. TESTED ON SUBSTRATE, which is the reference row the census has no filer for. gate_census --baselines answers with 19 ratchets, 7 ok and 11 EMPTY and 1 UNREAD, where EMPTY is the zero-tolerance setting the legend names as strongest rather than as a defect. Plus the per-file gate that has refused edits repeatedly this session. So substrate answers the honest key affirmatively WITH EVIDENCE, and the reference column the census lacks is derivable from a tool rather than from prose. AND MY FIRST PROBE OF THIS WAS ALSO A FALSE ZERO. pycodemod --literal over pyproject.toml for the ruff section returned 0 of 1, because pycodemod is a PYTHON reader and pyproject is TOML -- a fact about the instrument reported as a fact about the file, while gabion measured four such sections in that same file today. Second false zero in two ticks from reaching for a reader that does not own the artifact, which is the standing rule read backwards.}
