ng by ls.compare, which contains no apostrophe, also returns 0, so the whole SECTION is unreachable rather than the match being confounded by the character. That is summit's parent-absorption shape confirmed in a mode neither of us was testing. WHAT SURVIVES FROM gate-G136 is the instruction finding — the standing directive names --headers as defective and prescribes --budget, --headers is not defective, so the directive misidentifies its own subject while its prescribed workaround happens to avoid the real defect as well. WHAT IS RETRACTED is does-not-reproduce. It reproduces, in --spans, on this file. UNWITNESSED because the discriminating quantity is a census value — --spans exits 0 whether it returns zero sections or many, so no exit code distinguishes the defect from a correct empty result, which the polarity probe refused a refuses: filing on.}
