ct about one search. AND IT WAS A BINDING, NOT A MODULE. file_header.missing already existed, already documented, bound to nothing — its docstring even states that the denominator is the caller's to print. main refused every argument with a bare if argv guard, so the reader was reachable only by import. The repair is one arm calling a function that was already there. VERIFIED — file_header --missing enumerates the population and every row reads NEITHER with zero PARTIAL, which matches the census's own 0 carry exactly one. Suite 26 of 26 unchanged. ⚑ THE SHAPE IS THE BUILT-THEN-ORPHANED RUNG, and this session has now recorded it twice in two ticks from opposite sides — scan_root is a clean module nothing imports because its consumer is gate-blocked, and missing was a clean function nothing called because its dispatch never grew an arm. One is blocked and one was merely unbound, and only opening the file distinguishes them.}
