ot evidence the hazard is rare, only that this batch did not contain it, and bib_check was one of sixteen in the last two. VERIFIED ON TWO SUITES FROM DIFFERENT FAMILIES — ratchet_key selftest 15 of 15 and drain_order selftest 14 of 14, chosen because they are cheap and read the edited modules. AND A THIRD VERIFICATION RAN PAST ITS TIMEOUT. substrate/drain_plan.py did not complete within 120s and was backgrounded, which is a fact about that tool's cost rather than about the edit — it joins drain candidates to consumers and to the checker, so it walks the corpus. Recorded because a reader seeing a backgrounded verification might read it as a hang caused by the change, and the two cheap suites are the evidence that the edits are inert.}
