@misc{gate-G391-the-first-drain-found-the-origin-missing-a-real-dependency,
  section  = {finding},
  claim    = {A differential against the origin is the arm a drain owes, and it found the origin classifying a real guarded sys.path insert as a mere mention.},
  check    = {selftest:python3,-m,substrate.scratch_refs_selftest},
  note     = {kind=finding by=momentum. First extraction of the drain arc. check_scratch_independence's three scratch-reference readers moved into substrate/scratch_refs.py, typed at the seams, logic unchanged. The differential found store.py:705 — a sys.path.insert feeding a join of scratch inside a try, the canonical guarded coupling — listed by the origin's --mentions as not a runtime dependency. The new reader finds it, and the suite asserts the disagreement as a known correction rather than pinning a miss. A dependency site is the CALL's line, not the literal's, which every origin row uses. AND A PLANT DID NOT FIRE: widening the argument walk left the diagnostic arm green because reasons.append is rejected on the receiver before any argument is inspected — two recorded defects shared one fixture and one was structurally unexercised. Split it, and the plant fires. 14/14, both halves clean, staged. Narrowing a Constant's value leaves the caller with a bare AST and no lineno — the helper must return the narrowed node. ⚑ WITNESS NOTE, moved verbatim from findings.py WITNESSES (2026-09-26): The drain arc's first extraction. check_scratch_independence carries 363 findings and refused a one-line arm repair, so its three scratch-reference readers — scan_file, _dep_sites, _guard_depth — moved into substrate/scratch_refs.py, typed at the seams and unchanged in logic. THE DIFFERENTIAL IS THE ARM A DRAIN OWES, and it found two things. First, the ORIGIN MISSES A REAL DEPENDENCY: jea/metalanguage/store.py:705 is _s2.path.insert(0, _o2.path.join(…, scratch)) inside a try — the canonical guarded coupling this gate exists to find — and the origin's --mentions lists it as NOT a runtime dependency. The new reader finds it. The suite asserts the disagreement as a known correction rather than matching a miss, because a differential that pinned the origin there would be pinning a defect. Second, the line convention: a dependency site is the CALL's line, not the literal's, which is what every origin dependency row uses — a first draft pinned the mentions listing's 706 and was wrong by one. ⚑⚑ AND A PLANT DID NOT FIRE. Widening the argument walk to ast.walk left the diagnostic arm green, because reasons.append is rejected on the RECEIVER before any argument is inspected — the fixture tested the append trap and never reached the descendant walk. Two recorded defects, one fixture, one of them structurally unexercised. Split into its own fixture with a path-shaped call and a two-level nesting, and the plant fires. Suite 14/14, both halves CLEAN, staged. Four write attempts to land the module, each refusal one real seam — the last was that narrowing a Constant's VALUE leaves the caller holding a bare AST with no lineno, so the helper must return the narrowed NODE.}
}

